[1m[38;5;231mWhen should a task's reminder fire?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mLead time, then due (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mTwo notifications per task: one at dueAt minus a global lead time, one at dueAt. No nagging afterward.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m At due time only
     [38;5;246mExactly one notification per task, when it becomes due. Simplest possible state.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Lead, due, then overdue
     [38;5;246mKeeps reminding at intervals after the deadline until completed or dismissed. Needs snooze/dismiss UI.[39m
